[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0010","text":"哦——\n用贝壳玩神经衰弱啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0020","text":"好像是平安时代左右的游戏吧？\n现在还能玩啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0030","text":"是的……把蛤蜊的贝壳……\n只取一片……排在席上……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0040","text":"从排好的贝壳中……\n找出……能与另一片相合的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0050","text":"嘿——……形状都差不多的\n感觉随便哪个都行啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0060","text":"看起来是这样，\n但蛤蜊的贝壳，没有两片是完全相同的哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0070","text":"所以，能完美契合的只有一对"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0080","text":"原来如此……！\n好厉害啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0090","text":"那，接下来要比一场吗？\n——赢了的话怎么办？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0100","text":"那么……奖品是……\n可乐饼……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_03_0007","text":"Motion"}]
